WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.365
[DOOR OPENING]

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:16.010
We pick up right where
we left the Turners

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.090
at the end of Season One.

00:00:17.715 --> 00:00:18.712
Do you have him?

00:00:18.712 --> 00:00:19.420
Who?

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.820
[HEAVY BREATHING]

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.000
The child is missing--

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.480
--and Dorothy believes that
the cult has taken their child.

00:00:27.274 --> 00:00:31.970
Her-- this woman was in my house
today, and she took Jericho.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.000
Part of what makes a
thriller is stakes.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.680
And the timetable
is critical to that.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.875
So in her mind, she has 48 hours
to find this baby, or else.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.125
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:45.250
You need to establish roadblocks
on a 50 mile perimeter

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.230
around this city.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:47.960
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:51.530
I shouldn't have to tell
you how to do your job.

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:54.980
Sean is halfheartedly
looking for the baby

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:58.100
because there is no baby
to look for in his mind.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:01.250
So he's in an in-between
place of I'm not sure.

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.215
I think I lost my mind too.

00:01:03.215 --> 00:01:05.090
Dorothy hasn't been
right since the accident.

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:05.960
She's not crazy.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.430
No one is using that word.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:12.290
The way I saw Dorothy
was very theatrical.

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:14.330
And the turmoil
that's going on in her

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:16.610
is being represented
by her mania

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:19.280
both in front of the camera,
but also in real life.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:20.270
Don't just stand there!

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:20.940
Do something!

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:24.410
I try to show it, even in the
clothing and the big patterns

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:25.490
that she's wearing.

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.950
There's a sense of the
things that are going wrong.

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:29.250
This not a person at peace.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.792
This is not a person
that's balanced.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:43.730
[GASP]

